6% in Q1 FY27.","themes":{"guidance":[],"demand_outlook":[{"claim":"Copper Tubes & Pipes increased its share in revenue mix from 14% to 26%, supporting long-term growth and portfolio diversification.","quote":"Copper Tubes & Pipes share improved significantly from 14% to 26%\nreflecting strategic diversification, positioning the portfolio for long-term\ngrowth and profitability.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=343d3b2e-8dbd-4ebb-ba66-e33153f86d79.pdf"}],"capex_expansion":[{"claim":"Tefabo Product is undertaking a phased capacity expansion at Vadodara to increase capacity from ~40 towers/month to ~80 towers/month.","quote":"\u2022 Vadodara, Gujarat \u2014 undertaking a phased capacity expansion, increasing capacity from\n~40 towers/month to ~80 towers/month","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=343d3b2e-8dbd-4ebb-ba66-e33153f86d79.pdf"},{"claim":"Expansion is planned in two phases, with Phase 1 to deliver 20 towers per month and Phase 2 to add another 20 towers per month upon achieving Phase 1 scale.","quote":"Expansion planned in two phases; Phase 1 to deliver 20 towers/month, Phase 2 to add another 20 towers/month upon achieving Phase 1 scale","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=bb0271f4-e0b8-489d-b304-9995c740496f.pdf"}],"margins_costs":[{"claim":"Consolidated Operating EBITDA grew 109.0% year-on-year to Rs 89.6 Crs in Q1 FY27 compared to Rs 42.9 Crs in Q1 FY26.","quote":"Operating EBITDA 89.6 42.9 +109.0% 93.2 263.6","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=343d3b2e-8dbd-4ebb-ba66-e33153f86d79.pdf"},{"claim":"Operating EBITDA margin expanded to 4.8% in Q1 FY27 compared to 4.4% in Q1 FY26.","quote":"EBITDA % 4.8% 4.4% 5.3% 5.1%","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=343d3b2e-8dbd-4ebb-ba66-e33153f86d79.pdf"},{"claim":"Gross profit margin was 8.9% in Q1 FY27 compared to 9.8% in Q1 FY26.","quote":"GP % 8.9% 9.8% 9.6% 10.1%","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=343d3b2e-8dbd-4ebb-ba66-e33153f86d79.pdf"},{"claim":"Exceptional item of INR 3.6 crore pertains to provisions or adjustments related to the implementation of new labor codes.","quote":"Exceptional item of INR 3.6 crore pertains to provisions/adjustments related to implementation of new labor codes","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=bb0271f4-e0b8-489d-b304-9995c740496f.pdf"}],"orders_capacity":[{"claim":"EPAVO Electricals has an installed capacity of 30 lakh motors per annum.","quote":"30 lakh motors/annum installed; >90% localisation in HVLS PMSM motors.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-10-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=8031cac2-7f66-4eca-beb5-1644657eb477.pdf"},{"claim":"The company holds 30 to 40 percent of the market in key product segments for wind turbine tower internals.","quote":"Holds 30\u201340% of the market in key product segments","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=bb0271f4-e0b8-489d-b304-9995c740496f.pdf"},{"claim":"The manufacturing capacity for wind turbine tower internals at Bangalore, Karnataka is approximately 40 towers per month.","quote":"Capacity: ~40 towers/month","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=bb0271f4-e0b8-489d-b304-9995c740496f.pdf"}],"capital_allocation":[{"claim":"The company distributed a total dividend of Rs. 5.0 per share for FY24 including a special interim dividend and a final dividend.","quote":"# Rs. 2.50 Sp